      "writtenOn": "2026-10-13T09:06:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s collection specific:\nClassic Ansible roles spread their plugins across separate top-level dirs — library/ (modules), module_utils/, lookup_plugins/, filter_plugins/, action_plugins/\nAnsible collections, by contrast, consolidate all plugin types under one directory: plugins/modules/, plugins/filter/, plugins/action/,\n  plugins/lookup/, etc.",
      "parentUuid": "7f46b7dc_ed1e2f20",
